So, I guess it's time to talk... about that important announcement...

529
00:25:37,845 --> 00:25:46,565
Ticket sales for the Saitama Super Arena concert on March 20, 2025 will end at 23:59 today.

530
00:25:46,565 --> 00:25:57,724
I know there were a lot of people who were planning to buy the tickets later last time, so I don't think that will happen, but I really want you to buy the tickets.

531
00:25:57,724 --> 00:25:59,560
I really hope you'll buy it.

532
00:25:59,560 --> 00:26:10,941
We have no choice but to work hard from here, so all the members will do our best so that everyone will follow us.

533
00:26:10,941 --> 00:26:14,040
If you're interested, I'd be happy if you came!

534
00:26:14,040 --> 00:26:25,760
So, if you're interested, I'd love it if you'd come to the show.

535
00:26:25,760 --> 00:26:28,900
I'll tell you what, today is November 20...

536
00:26:28,904 --> 00:26:30,904
Today is November 20/7.

537
00:26:30,904 --> 00:26:32,904
November's early.

538
00:26:32,904 --> 00:26:36,904
It's only November 30.

539
00:26:36,904 --> 00:26:38,904
12, 12, 3...

540
00:26:38,904 --> 00:26:40,904
12, 12, 3...

541
00:26:40,904 --> 00:26:42,904
And February is only 28.

542
00:26:42,904 --> 00:26:44,904
That's not much.

543
00:26:44,904 --> 00:26:46,904
Well, well, well.

544
00:26:46,904 --> 00:26:50,904
I'm looking forward to it, though.

545
00:26:50,904 --> 00:26:56,729
I think it's my duty as an idol to entertain everyone at the concert.

546
00:26:56,729 --> 00:27:03,048
I think it's my duty as an idol, so I'm going to do my best to make sure that I can entertain everyone.

547
00:27:03,048 --> 00:27:03,348
I'll definitely do my best to entertain you.

548
00:27:03,348 --> 00:27:08,429
No, no, no, no, no, no... when you decided to do this...

549
00:27:08,429 --> 00:27:09,249
No, no, no, no, no...

550
00:27:09,256 --> 00:27:15,476
We'll be there on the day of the show, of course, but it's quite a distance from Yokohama, you know...

551
00:27:15,476 --> 00:27:25,076
It's a long way from Yokohama, so we always say we won't be able to catch the last train after the show.

552
00:27:25,076 --> 00:27:36,836
We're talking about staying at a business hotel in Omiya or something.

553
00:27:36,840 --> 00:27:46,900
I'll see you all again next week at 8:00 p.m.

554
00:27:46,900 --> 00:27:52,060
Thank you very much for your time this week.

555
00:27:52,060 --> 00:27:54,400
Thank you very much.
